# Silver Knight (2/2, First Strike) attacks; Devoted Hero (1/2, no first
# strike) blocks. The Knight's 2 damage is exactly lethal to the Hero's 2
# toughness in the first-strike step; the advance into Combat Damage runs the
# state-based-action check that kills the Hero before the regular step ever
# asks whether it deals damage back -- CR 510.4, CR 510.1c's "attacker
# remains blocked but a removed blocker gets nothing" via a dead blocker
# rather than a dead attacker this time.
startturn human
advance 5
queue attackers 1
declareattackers
advance
queue blocks 2=1
declareblockers
advance
firststrikedamage
advance
combatdamage
